+    the JSON attribute ``mesozoic_tail3_bound``; a config sets ``model._tail3_bound`` (never saved) and the attribute
+    ``mesozoic_tail3_bound`` (:meth:`Tail3UpperBoundConfig.checkpoint_record`, saved as JSON).
